    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d419">

                <pb facs="0498" n="424" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav01/pg424"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72119/1074</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Russia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Francis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Petrograd</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-01-05T10:00:00+02:31">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 5, 1918, 10 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 11.41 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2202. German peace commissioners refused to go Stockholm, consequently Trotsky himself going Brest to-night hoping to
                    induce adjournment to some neutral ground.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Francis</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
